          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个地址要先有正确的 Key 才肯列出模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This address will not list its models without a correct key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个地址要先有正确的 Key 才肯列出模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个键会输入字符，多出来的会被整行替换掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This key types a character; the extra ones are replaced along with the line."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个键会输入字符，多出来的会被整行替换掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是 macOS 的全局设置，改这里等同于改系统设置，影响所有 app。关掉后用空格触发不会再冒出句号；已经开着的 app 可能要重开才生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a system-wide macOS setting, so changing it here is the same as changing it in System Settings and it affects every app. With it off, triggering with Space no longer leaves a stray period. Apps that are already running may need to be restarted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 macOS 的全局设置，改这里等同于改系统设置，影响所有 app。关掉后用空格触发不会再冒出句号；已经开着的 app 可能要重开才生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
